1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,500
日落时分，在半公里深的海里，有东西开始往上游。
At sunset, half a kilometre down, something starts to climb.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,674
一条灯笼鱼，还没有手指长。
A lanternfish, no longer than your finger.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:14,300
它摸着黑，一路游向海面。
It climbs toward the surface, in the dark.

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:19,500
可头顶那点微光，会把它照成一个影子。
But the faint light from above turns it into a shadow.

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,200
下面的猎手，正抬头往上看。
And hunters below are looking up.

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,500
于是，它点亮肚子上的一排灯，
So it turns on the lights along its belly,

7
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:32,350
和头顶的光一样亮。影子不见了。
as bright as the glow above. The shadow is gone.

8
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:36,450
到了午夜，它游到海面觅食。
By midnight, it reaches the surface to feed.

9
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:39,150
而它并不孤单。
And it is not alone.

10
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:43,250
每天夜里，无数动物从深海升起。
Every night, countless animals rise from the deep.

11
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:46,900
这是地球上规模最大的迁徙。
It is the largest migration on Earth.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,600
日出之前，它们又一起沉回黑暗。
Before sunrise, they all sink back into the dark.

